[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m - When she walks at speed $ s + 2 $ km/h, the total time (including coffee shop) is **2 hours and 24 minutes**, which is **2.4 hours**.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m - We are to find the total time in minutes when she walks at speed $ s + \frac{1}{2} $ km/h, **including the $ t $ minutes in the coffee shop**.
