[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m \frac{9}{s} = 4 - \frac{t}{60} \quad \text{(Equation 1)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m ### Step 2: Use second scenario
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m She walks **at speed $ s + 2 $ km/h**, and total time is 2 hours and 24 minutes = **2.4 hours**.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m \text{Walking time at speed } s + 2 = \frac{9}{s + 2} \text{ hours}
