[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m ### Step 3: Solve system of equations
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m From Equation 1:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m $$
