[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m 3^b \times 7^d, \quad \text{where } 0 \leq b \leq 4, \, 0 \leq d \leq 1
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m $$
