[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m Divide $ 9b + 7 $ by $ b + 7 $. Using polynomial division:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m - Divide $ 9b $ by $ b $ to get 9
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m - Multiply $ b + 7 $ by 9: $ 9b + 63 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m - Subtract $ 9b + 63 $ from $ 9b + 7 $: $ -56 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m Thus, we can express:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m \frac{9b + 7}{b + 7} = 9 - \frac{56}{b + 7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=274509)[0m 
